<p>On the basis of exchange rates from 16-20 May, the UK average RMG is above +5 per cent at 5.330 per cent. It is therefore currently forecast to enter a fifth and final confirmation period on 26 May, prior to a possible revaluation on 5 June. All currencies with negative RMGs for this period will be devalued on 26 May by reducing their negative gaps to zero. Hence devaluations are currently forecast for the Belgian and Greek green rates.</p>
